# Safety net for repo-root-context builds (the fork-indexer image —
# sandbox/docker/deepbook-indexer-fork/Dockerfile). Under BuildKit the
# per-Dockerfile Dockerfile.dockerignore allowlist wins; this file only guards
# the legacy builder (DOCKER_BUILDKIT=0), where shipping the repo root
# verbatim would upload node_modules, .git, and the submodule target/ tree.
.git
**/node_modules
external/deepbook/target
**/.devstack
